          0.030                % d_Th_opt [-] optimum change of soil moisture
          0.030                % d_Phi_opt [-] optimum change of suction head
          7                    % n_gr (3) threshold for reducing reducing time step but carrying on the actual iteration
         12                    % it_max (7) max. number of Picard-iterations
          1.e-4                % piceps [-] (1.e-3) convergence criterium for Picard iteration
          1.e-7                % cgeps  [m] (5.e-6) convergence criterium for cg method.
         15.                   % rlongi longitude for computation of time (CET)
